easy-connection (0.1.1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Tunnel latency: TCP_NODELAY on SOCKS/HTTP/transproxy and SSH dial,
    larger SSH channel window, DNS-over-TCP only as documented fallback,
    and reuse of DNS-over-TCP streams across lookups.
  * Full-tunnel Connect elevates easy-helper via polkit/pkexec
    (com.easyconnection.helper.run); no manual sudo required when policy
    is installed. Honest elevation-denied / pkexec-missing errors.
  * Ship and uninstall polkit policy with the .deb; policykit-1 dependency.
  * App icon regenerated from apps/desktop/src-tauri/icon.png for GNOME
    hicolor / taskbar (Icon=easy-connection).

 -- Easy Connection Contributors <easy@localhost>  Thu, 27 Aug 2026 14:00:00 +0000

